{"seq":1,"slug":"vertical-merge","title":"多 vertical 结果合并与位次分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/blending-engine/vertical-merge","wordCount":2786,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多-vertical-结果合并与位次分配\">多 vertical 结果合并与位次分配</h1><p>在一个通用搜索框里敲下&quot;露营&quot;，系统背后其实有至少四路并发请求在跑：商品库返回灯具与帐篷，店铺库返回户外用品店，内容库返回攻略与测评，广告系统返回投放中的商品。每一路都按自己的模型给出一个有序列表，每一路都认为自己排第一的那条最相关。而页面上只有一份序列——哪个位置放商品、哪个位置放攻略、店铺出现在第几屏，这个决定叫位次分配。它比听起来难得多，因为四路的分数量纲根本不可比：商品分是 0–1 的归一化相关性，内容分来自另一个模型，广告分本质上是出价乘预估点击率。直接比较这些数毫无意义。</p>\n<p>这一篇处理位次分配的核心方法。它假设每一路的结果已经拿到（召回与精排属于 <a href=\"../ranking-funnel/cascade-stages\">召回、粗排、精排、重排的延迟预算分配</a> 的范围），也不涉及电商卡片特有的约束（那是 <a href=\"card-quality-score\">电商卡片质量分与插入约束</a> 的主题）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分数不可比的三种解法\">核心概念：分数不可比的三种解法</h2><p>位次分配的第一个问题是：怎么让不同来源的分数变得可比。有三种解法，它们的假设、成本与效果都不同。</p>\n<p><strong>解法一：分数归一化（score normalization）。</strong> 把每一路的原始分数映射到同一个可比空间。常用的映射有两种。一是<strong>分位数映射</strong>：取历史上一段时间该路分数的经验分布，把原始分映射到它在该分布中的分位（0 到 1）。二是<strong>z-score 标准化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(s - \\mu) / \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，用该路的均值与标准差做线性变换。分位数映射对分布形状不敏感，但需要有足够的历史样本；z-score 简单但假设分布近似正态，对长尾分数（比如广告出价）会失真。</p>\n<p><strong>解法二：位置模型（position model）。</strong> 不比较分数，而是把每一路的结果按它们在各自列表中的位置作为输入，学一个统一的打分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>vertical</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>rank</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>features</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\text{vertical}, \\text{rank}, \\text{features})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vertical</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">features</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个做法的洞见是：不同路上的&quot;第 1 名&quot;含有的信息量是可比的，即使分数不可比。它天然处理了&quot;某一路整体偏保守、分数普遍偏低&quot;的问题。代价是需要训练数据，且当一路新增或下线时需要重新训。</p>\n<p><strong>解法三：端到端学习混排（learned blending）。</strong> 把各路的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 结果连同它们的元信息（来源、分数、位置、以及少量强特征）一起送给一个混排模型，由它直接输出最终序列。这个做法的表达力最强，能学到&quot;攻略在查询是活动策划时应该插在商品前面&quot;这类上下文规则。代价是候选量小（混排要看十几到几十条，多路加起来上百条），训练与推理的成本比前两者高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>训练数据需求</th>\n<th>表达力</th>\n<th>延迟成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分数归一化</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无（用历史分布）</td>\n<td>低（只看分数）</td>\n<td>极低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 每条）</td>\n<td>来源少、量纲相近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置模型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要点击日志</td>\n<td>中（含位置信息）</td>\n<td>低（一次线性/浅模型）</td>\n<td>来源多、分数不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端混排</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要混排场景的标注</td>\n<td>高（含上下文）</td>\n<td>中（数十条 × 深模型）</td>\n<td>需要上下文规则时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[商品路 top-k] --&gt; D[分数归一化]&#10;    B[店铺路 top-k] --&gt; D&#10;    C[内容路 top-k] --&gt; D&#10;    E[广告路 top-k] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; F{选择合并策略}&#10;    F --&gt;|分位数/z-score| G[统一分数空间]&#10;    F --&gt;|位置模型| H[按 vertical + rank 打分]&#10;    F --&gt;|端到端| I[混排模型直接输出]&#10;    G --&gt; J[按统一分排序 分配位次]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[约束调整 见电商卡片篇]\">graph TD\n    A[商品路 top-k] --&gt; D[分数归一化]\n    B[店铺路 top-k] --&gt; D\n    C[内容路 top-k] --&gt; D\n    E[广告路 top-k] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; F{选择合并策略}\n    F --&gt;|分位数/z-score| G[统一分数空间]\n    F --&gt;|位置模型| H[按 vertical + rank 打分]\n    F --&gt;|端到端| I[混排模型直接输出]\n    G --&gt; J[按统一分排序 分配位次]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[约束调整 见电商卡片篇]</pre><h2 id=\"合并算法的公平性与配额\">合并算法的公平性与配额</h2><p>有了可比的分数，下一个问题是：纯按分数排序是否合理。答案通常是不——因为它会造成<strong>赢者通吃</strong>。</p>\n<p>假设商品路的候选池比内容路大一个数量级，且两路分数经归一化后同分布。那么排在前面的位置几乎必然被商品占据，内容只能出现在很后面。从用户价值看这可能是错的：一个查询如果同时有转化意图和信息意图，页面全是商品会损失一部分用户的满意度。这就是混排引擎必须引入<strong>配额与公平性约束</strong>的原因。</p>\n<p>三种常见的配额机制：</p>\n<p><strong>机制一：硬配额。</strong> 每路至少占前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置。比如前 10 位里至少 1 个内容位。实现简单，但与&quot;某路没有好结果&quot;冲突——硬插一条差内容是负价值的。补救是配额可以<strong>有条件豁免</strong>：只有当该路最高分超过阈值时才保证配额。</p>\n<p><strong>机制二：软化（score prior / boost）。</strong> 不设配额，而是给每路一个先验加成或惩罚，用分数调整表达偏好。这本质上是把配额问题转成了分数问题，代价是需要调参且不同查询下最优参数不同。</p>\n<p><strong>机制三：公平性排序（fair ranking）。</strong> 用一组明确的效用函数做约束优化，比如在满足&quot;每路的期望曝光与其质量成正比&quot;的前提下最大化总相关性。这比硬配额更细致，但计算量更大，通常只用于离线评估或小候选集（来源：Singh &amp; Joachims, &quot;Fairness of Exposure in Rankings&quot;, KDD 2018——以曝光分配为约束的公平排序框架, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.07281）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.07281）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配额机制</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>与&quot;某路无好结果&quot;的冲突</th>\n<th>可调性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬配额</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>冲突明显</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>强合规要求（如必须有店铺入口）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有条件配额</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可豁免</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分数先验</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无冲突（自然降权）</td>\n<td>中（需调参）</td>\n<td>偏好表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公平性排序</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无冲突</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>离线评估、小候选集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;有条件豁免&quot;的硬配额在实践中最常见。它的判据可以写成一个简单的不等式：只有当第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 路在该位次之后的最高分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_v^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9114em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与当前应占该位次的分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>cur</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{cur}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的差不超过容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 时，才执行配额插入。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>insert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>cur</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{insert}(v) \\iff s_v^{\\max} \\ge s_{\\text{cur}} - \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">insert</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，配额越强硬（越愿意为公平牺牲相关性）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为纯按分数排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位次分配的延迟结构\">位次分配的延迟结构</h2><p>位次分配本身的计算是廉价的（排序上百条是微秒级），它的延迟问题不在计算而在<strong>等待</strong>。混排引擎必须等各路都返回才能开始合并，或者至少等到足够多的路返回。于是混排的延迟实际上由<strong>最慢的那一路</strong>决定，这与 <a href=\"../feature-serving/feature-fetch-cache\">特征获取、缓存与本地化</a> 里的&quot;扇出取最大&quot;是同一个规律（来源：Dean &amp; Barroso, &quot;The Tail at Scale&quot;, CACM 56(2), 2013, <a href=\"https://research.google/pubs/the-tail-at-scale/）。\">https://research.google/pubs/the-tail-at-scale/）。</a></p>\n<p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 路的响应时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，混排开始的时刻是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_v T_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（全部等待）或某个超时后的部分等待。两种策略的取舍很清晰：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>混排</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>全等</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>超时即合并已到的</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{混排}} = \\begin{cases} \\max_v T_v &amp; \\text{全等} \\\\ T_{\\text{deadline}} &amp; \\text{超时即合并已到的} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">混排</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全等</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">超时即合并已到的</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>全等能拿到完整信息、合并质量最好，但尾延迟被最慢的一路拖住。超时即合并在延迟上是确定的，但可能出现&quot;某一路完全没赶上&quot;的情形——此时需要保底策略，这是 <a href=\"blending-fallback\">混排超时下的保底策略</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>一个重要的工程优化是<strong>把合并本身增量化</strong>。不要等全部结果到齐再排序一次，而是按到达顺序把每一路的结果插入已有的序列（用 <a href=\"card-quality-score\">电商卡片质量分与插入约束</a> 中讨论的插入模型）。增量合并的好处是：当最后一路迟到时，前几路的结果已经就位，超时后可以直接输出当前序，无需一次额外的全排序。代价是插入顺序会影响最终结果（不满足交换律时尤其如此），需要保证合并逻辑对顺序不敏感或在最后做一次微调。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[并发发起多路请求] --&gt; B[商品路返回 t=20ms]&#10;    A --&gt; C[店铺路返回 t=35ms]&#10;    A --&gt; D[内容路返回 t=80ms]&#10;    A --&gt; E[广告路返回 t=25ms]&#10;    B --&gt; F[增量合并 插入当前序]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{是否到合并截止时间}&#10;    G --&gt;|否 内容路到达| H[插入内容结果 全序完整]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[输出当前序 + 保底]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    H --&gt; J[约束调整 输出最终序列]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[并发发起多路请求] --&gt; B[商品路返回 t=20ms]\n    A --&gt; C[店铺路返回 t=35ms]\n    A --&gt; D[内容路返回 t=80ms]\n    A --&gt; E[广告路返回 t=25ms]\n    B --&gt; F[增量合并 插入当前序]\n    C --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{是否到合并截止时间}\n    G --&gt;|否 内容路到达| H[插入内容结果 全序完整]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[输出当前序 + 保底]\n    D --&gt; F\n    H --&gt; J[约束调整 输出最终序列]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"观测与调优的闭环\">观测与调优的闭环</h2><p>位次分配的参数（配额、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>、先验加成）无法纯靠离线评估调好，因为它们直接影响曝光分配，而曝光分配又影响后续的点击数据——这是一个反馈回路；位置偏置的点击数据本身就需要反事实/倾向加权方法才能无偏使用（来源：Joachims, Swaminathan &amp; Schnabel, &quot;Unbiased Learning-to-Rank with Biased Feedback&quot;, arXiv:1608.04468, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.04468）。评估方式因此必须以**在线实验**为主。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.04468）。评估方式因此必须以**在线实验**为主。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观察对象</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各路曝光占比</td>\n<td>按 vertical 的位置分布</td>\n<td>检查配额是否生效、是否过度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各路在各位置的 CTR</td>\n<td>按 (vertical, position) 的点击率</td>\n<td>判断该路的分数校准是否合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首个异质结果的位置</td>\n<td>内容/店铺第一次出现的位置</td>\n<td>混排体验的核心观感指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位次跳变率</td>\n<td>同查询两次请求的位次差异</td>\n<td>判断混合是否稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并阶段的耗时分布</td>\n<td>max 与 p99</td>\n<td>定位是等待还是计算的问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;位次跳变率&quot;是一个不常被统计但很有用的指标。混排引入了更多随机与并发因素（多路的分片、超时、缓存命中差异），如果同一查询连续两次请求的位次差异很大，用户体验上会表现为&quot;结果在跳&quot;，这既影响信任也影响埋点归因的准确性。位次跳变率异常升高通常意味着某一路的结果不稳定（缓存命中率波动、或该路自身的 p99 恶化）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多路合并的难点不在排序算法，而在分数可比性与公平性这两个非技术直觉的问题上。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分数不可比有三种解法：分位数/z-score 归一化（便宜、表达力弱）、位置模型（用 rank 替代分数，天然处理量纲差异）、端到端学习混排（表达力强、成本高）。选择依据是来源数与是否需要上下文规则。</li>\n<li>纯按分数排序会导致赢者通吃，必须引入配额；四种机制里&quot;有条件豁免的硬配额&quot;最常用，判据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>cur</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_v^{\\max} \\ge s_{\\text{cur}} - \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9114em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制公平与相关性的交换率。</li>\n<li>位次分配的计算是微秒级，延迟问题在等待——混排的延迟由最慢的一路决定（与特征扇出同源规律）；增量合并避免结果到齐后的一次全排序，但需保证顺序不敏感。</li>\n<li>调优必须靠在线实验，因为曝光分配与点击数据构成反馈回路；位次跳变率是一个被低估的稳定性指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>电商卡片是混排里约束最重的一类条目——它带质量分、有插入约束，需要在位次空间上做局部求解，见 <a href=\"card-quality-score\">电商卡片质量分与插入约束</a>。当某一路没赶上截止时间，如何输出仍然说得过去的结果，见 <a href=\"blending-fallback\">混排超时下的保底策略</a>；多路并发扇出的尾延迟治理与 <a href=\"../2-feature-serving/feature-store-latency\">特征存储的延迟治理</a> 中讨论的扇出取最大是同一套方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多 vertical 结果合并与位次分配","id":"多-vertical-结果合并与位次分配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分数不可比的三种解法","id":"核心概念-分数不可比的三种解法"},{"level":2,"text":"合并算法的公平性与配额","id":"合并算法的公平性与配额"},{"level":2,"text":"位次分配的延迟结构","id":"位次分配的延迟结构"},{"level":2,"text":"观测与调优的闭环","id":"观测与调优的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特征存储的延迟治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/feature-serving/feature-store-latency"},"next":{"title":"电商卡片质量分与插入约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/blending-engine/card-quality-score"}}